WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.646
Your next anatomy exam deserves more than flat diagrams.

2
00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:05.124
Meet Osteon:

3
00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:07.798
a free study space that makes anatomy click.

4
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.498
In the 3D atlas, drag to rotate, and scroll or pinch to zoom.

5
00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:18.950
Double-click or double-tap to explore a
region, then again to focus one bone.

6
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.602
Back restores context.

7
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.667
Tap Muscles to add muscle layers without losing your view.

8
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.907
Choose a region, select a muscle, and use
Peel to look beneath covering surfaces.

9
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.363
Turn on Landmarks for clear markers.

10
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:43.428
Select one to reveal its name, then choose
Show best view to inspect the target.

11
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.146
Open Practice Lab and name the highlighted structure.

12
00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:55.602
Clear spelling slips can keep credit, while feedback
helps you separate terminology from concept gaps.

13
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:03.580
Study Studio connects OpenStax chapters six
through ten with guided lessons, source readings,

14
00:01:03.654 --> 00:01:04.972
and interactive activities.

15
00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:09.537
Choose a chapter exam or mixed review, then save and resume later.

16
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.211
Need a nudge?

17
00:01:14.915 --> 00:01:19.407
With Ollama running on your computer, choose
an installed model in Socratic Tutor.

18
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:23.776
Ask a question and work through the reasoning, one step at a time.

19
00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:30.798
My Progress turns practice history into focused review.

20
00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:34.798
Revisit weak spots, and take your studying from desktop to phone.

21
00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:44.298
Built by an anatomy and physiology student as he learns,
Osteon keeps growing with new content and improvements.

22
00:01:44.828 --> 00:01:45.646
Free to open.

23
00:01:46.089 --> 00:01:46.950
No account needed.

24
00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:49.841
Try it today, and share it with your class.
